    direction LR

    %% ============================================================
    %% Acceptor Sub-State FSM (3 states)
    %% ============================================================
    %% Acceptor responds to Proposer requests.
    %% Simpler than Proposer — no quorum logic, no multi-phase.
    %% ============================================================

    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Accepting : first permissible\nPermissionRequest received

    Accepting --> Accepting : update promise / accepted\non each valid request

    %% --- Simulation Control ---
    Idle --> AcceptorInactive : MakeNodeInactive\n[Simulation Control]
    AcceptorInactive --> Idle : ActivateNode\n— restore from Storage\n[Simulation Control]

    note right of Accepting
        Tracks two values:
        · promised — highest proposal promised to
        · accepted — last value actually accepted
        ⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯
        Both are carried in acceptor_record.
    end note

    note right of AcceptorInactive
        Simulation-level, not protocol-level.
        Same pattern as ProposerInactive.
    end note
